    "firstBidAccepted": {
      "step1Title": "Accept This Bid",
      "step1Desc": "Clicking Accept starts a multi-stage process: your device proves ownership via a zero-knowledge proof (~3 minutes), then two chained transactions rekey the data to the buyer and release their ADA to you.",
